settings-steam-backend-card = Download method
settings-steam-backend-label = Method
settings-steam-backend-desc = Choose whether downloads use the running Steam client or steamcmd. Restart the wallpaper service after changing this.
settings-steam-backend-steam = Steam Client (recommended; uses your running Steam, no login)
settings-steam-backend-steamcmd = steamcmd (no Steam client; needs steamcmd + a one-time login)
settings-steam-username-label = Username
settings-steam-username-desc = Only used by steamcmd. Enter the Steam account that owns Wallpaper Engine.
settings-steam-username-placeholder = Steam username (for steamcmd)
settings-steam-api-key-label = API key
settings-steam-api-key-desc = Only needed when steamcmd is used for browsing. The Steam client method browses through the running client without a key.
settings-steam-api-key-placeholder = Steam API key
settings-steam-paths-card = Paths
settings-steam-paths-card-desc = These folders are normally detected from Steam. Set them manually only when detection finds the wrong installation.
settings-steam-workshop-dir-label = Workshop directory
settings-steam-workshop-dir-desc = Where Steam stores Workshop content.
settings-steam-workshop-dir-placeholder = Steam Workshop content path
settings-steam-assets-dir-label = WE assets directory
settings-steam-assets-dir-desc = Wallpaper Engine assets path.
settings-steam-assets-dir-placeholder = Wallpaper Engine assets path
settings-steam-steam-dir-label = Steam directory
settings-steam-steam-dir-desc = Steam install root.
settings-steam-steam-dir-placeholder = Steam install path
